    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7680791"
    >
Effective date.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680791" data-guid="7680791"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680791" data-guid="7680791" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680791_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This article shall be effective on and after January 1, 1992, if approved by a majority of the qualified electors in the City of Albany by proposition submitted at the general election to be held on November 5, 1991.<a class="footnoteref" href="#ft7680791-1" id="ref7680791-1">[1]</a></div><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7680791-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7680791-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: This ordinance was approved at referendum held 11-5-1991.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
